omments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T16:01:06.000Z"},{"id":"ityiYAJEd","title":"Building Voice Agents with Gemini Live API and Agora\u2019s Conversational AI","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ltcbA2CCTo","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/building-voice-agents-with-gemini-live-api-and-agora-s-conversational-ai-ityiyajed","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2ltcbA2CCTo/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-29T19:00:02.000Z"},{"id":"PSIOuHUfZ","title":"Introducing Keras Recommenders: state-of-the-art recommendation techniques at your fingertips","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZYeE4sYoRkw","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/introducing-keras-recommenders-state-of-the-art-recommendation-techniques-at-your-fingertips-psiouhufz","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZYeE4sYoRkw/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-28T23:00:42.000Z"},{"id":"nLlcZDtwY","title":"5 tips on keeping your code clean with Gemini","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJzxY_hhR6A","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/5-tips-on-keeping-your-code-clean-with-gemini-nllczdtwy","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AJzxY_hhR6A/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-28T19:00:08.000Z"},{"id":"d6RBtIhKr","title":"Git challenge: find the bad commit in the fewest commands","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eCHKCAWAnWE","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/find-the-commit-in-the-fewest-commands--d6rbtihkr","summary":"A Git challenge asking developers to find a bug-introducing commit among 500 commits using the fewest possible commands. The challenge hints at binary search strategies (like git bisect) and asks participants to share their approach, explain how many steps Git takes internally, and consider how the solution scales to thousands or millions of commits.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eCHKCAWAnWE/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-27T13:01:07.000Z"}],"top_posts":[{"id":"eqMU12PMD","title":"Three fundamental skills for early career software engineers","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P0flg_P8TK0","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/3-skills-every-early-career-engineer-needs-eqmu12pmd","summary":"Early-career software engineers should focus on three fundamental skills: writing clean, maintainable code with meaningful names and simple logic; developing a quality mindset through comprehensive testing that prevents regressions and enables confident refactoring; and mastering essential tools like version control, debugging techniques, documentation practices, and communication skills. These foundational practices create long-term career success more effectively than chasing the latest frameworks.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P0flg_P8TK0/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":100,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2025-12-10T17:00:47.000Z"},{"id":"2ZhfBj3Jy","title":"Developer jargon in real life situations","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xjgzfMhViPk","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/developer-jargon-irl-be-like--2zhfbj3jy","summary":"A humorous take on developer terminology used in everyday situations, playing on the double meaning of 'push' as both a physical action and a Git command for uploading code changes to a repository.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xjgzfMhViPk/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":15,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-22T05:01:08.000Z"},{"id":"wa5y8akEY","title":"Developers share their most underrated AI coding tool picks","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Igm94RIK1hY","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-the-most-underrated-tool-for-developers--wa5y8akey","summary":"Developers share their picks for the most underrated AI tool, with multiple respondents highlighting Anti-gravity as a standout multi-agent coding system. It is described as VS Code-like but with native AI capabilities spanning design to execution, generous model quotas, and usefulness for testing and building applications.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Igm94RIK1hY/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":15,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-10T04:00:31.000Z"},{"id":"udI5FqrrI","title":"Announcing ADK Go 1.0","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Alu4L3Pgzkw","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/announcing-adk-go-1-0-udi5fqrri","summary":"ADK Go 1.0 is released with several production-focused features for building enterprise-grade AI agents. Key additions include OpenTelemetry integration for deep observability into model calls and tool execution, an extensible plugin system (including a retry-and-reflect plugin for self-healing agents), human-in-the-loop confirmation for sensitive actions, YAML-based agent configuration, and an official Golang SDK for the agent-to-agent protocol. The release targets production reliability, security, and debuggability of non-deterministic AI agents.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Alu4L3Pgzkw/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":8,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-31T23:06:27.000Z"},{"id":"Foyh5uxSj","title":"Controlling a remote-controlled car with Gemma 3n on-device","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2cFKh6x6KUc","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/controlling-a-remote-controlled-car-with-gemma-3n-on-device-foyh5uxsj","summary":"Gemma 3N, available in 2B and 4B parameter variants, demonstrates on-device natural language processing capabilities by controlling a remote-controlled car through voice commands. The model interprets complex instructions like 'go forwards three times then turn left' and translates them into sequential vehicle movements, showcasing practical applications of edge AI in robotics and IoT devices.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2cFKh6x6KUc/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-02T18:18:36.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["devtoolsfm","de